android.desc:
It is an easy counter tool for free offline use. Count anything with a simple one-button design utility. 

<b>Easy Counter</b> is a simple clicker application. You can try it for any purpose. Add and name what you want to count with our tool. Tap the button to add numbers to what you count. Save the counted number in the application history. 

What will you click count today? That could be words, scores, cups you drink, things you order, laps you ran. Tap anything you need to keep on the clicker. 

<b>Counting tool</b> has a simple and clean-cut design. We have big buttons and an intuitive clicking UX. You can use the application on a go, in a hassle, or without looking on the screen. 

You will love <b>Easy Counter</b> for these features: 
●	Easy counter interface with clean design;
●	Minimum tuning and setting adjustment;
●	Multiple counters with unique names and values for anything;
●	Control with volume buttons;
●	Tap counting principle; 
●	Buttons counting interface;

Name the thing you count the taps for. Save the counting history till you need it. 

We make our tool work in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Hebrew. 

